OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FAt 1.47am, BBC One interrupts
OL,7,Fthe late film, Borsalino for a news
OL,8,Freport from Martyn Lewis: "We interrupt
OL,9,Fthis film to tell you we are getting
OL,10,Freports that Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,11,Fhas been badly injured in a car crash
OL,12,Fin France."
OL,13,
OL,14,FAt 3.15am, the British Ambassador in
OL,15,FParis (Sir Michael Jay) rang Balmoral
OL,16,Fto inform the Royal Family. When the
OL,17,FBBC domestic news operation came back
OL,18,Fon air later in the morning, Martyn
OL,19,FLewis, wearing a plain black tie, made
OL,20,Fthis announcement: "This is BBC
OL,21,FTelevision from London. Diana, Princess
OL,22,Fof Wales, has died after a car crash in
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
